ing":"Les 2: Eten en groeien","Eat 3 berries. Every berry makes you longer and adds to your score.":"Eet 3 bessen. Elke bes maakt je langer en draagt ​​bij aan je score.","Lesson 3: Danger":"Les 3: Gevaar","Walls, stones, and your own body are lethal. Survive 40 ticks while growing to length 6.":"Muren, stenen en je eigen lichaam zijn dodelijk. Overleef 40 ticks terwijl je uitgroeit tot lengte 6.","Lesson 4: Hunting Rivals":"Les 4: Op jacht naar rivalen","Small golden rivals are prey. Catch one with your head to defeat it.":"Kleine gouden rivalen zijn een prooi. Vang er een met je hoofd om hem te verslaan.","Lesson 5: Bigger Threats":"Les 5: Grotere bedreigingen","Large dark rivals hunt YOU. Any touch is fatal. Survive 60 ticks.":"Grote duistere rivalen jagen op JOU. Elke aanraking is fataal. Overleef 60 teken.","Counted Steps":"Getelde stappen","Finish 8 berries within 90 moves.":"Voltooi 8 bessen binnen 90 zetten.","Tailwind":"Rugwind","High speed: eat 10 berries.":"Hoge snelheid: eet 10 bessen.","Hedgemaze":"Haagdoolhof","A dense garden cross. Reach length 12.":"Een dichte tuinkruising. Bereik lengte 12.","Rival Rush":"Rivaliserende Rush","Defeat 4 small rivals while a big one prowls.":"Versla 4 kleine rivalen terwijl een grote rondzwervelt.","Golden Only":"Alleen goud","Score 400 with golden berries everywhere.":"Scoor 400 met overal gouden bessen.","The Gauntlet":"De uitdaging","Survive 300 ticks with two hunters.":"Overleef 300 teken met twee jagers.","Relaxed":"Ontspannen","Steady":"Stabiel","Brisk":"Vlot","Fierce":"Fel","The round is already over.":"De ronde is al afgelopen.","Unknown direction.":"Onbekende richting.","The serpent cannot reverse into itself.":"De slang kan niet in zichzelf terugkeren.","Command is not an object.":"Commando is geen object.","Unknown command type.":"Onbekend commandotype.","Low thud — serpent down":"Lage plof – slang naar beneden","Guest Gardener":"Gasttuinier","Bramble":"Braamstruik","Moss":"Mos","Thistle":"Distel","{name} (s